==>>HC32L07x_Rev1.2.0: Release 2022-07-16
1. Modified the pin definition for the TRIG port signal in adt.h.
2. Modified the definition of the en_sysctrl_pll_clksource_t member value in the PLL_CR.REFSEL enumeration in the SYSCTRL section.
3. Modified the PLL parameter configuration in sysctrl_clk_switch to use XTH multiplier.
4. Updated the logo, license, and FLM functions.
5. Added UART and LPUART timeout send functions.
6. Updated the IIC initialization process.
7. Updated the CAN_IrqFlgClr data to unsigned numbers.
8. Added channel capture mode settings to the general timer mode 1 example.

==>>HC32L07x_Rev1.1.2 Release 2020-08-02:
1. Updated CAN sample warning limit parameter configuration;

==>>HC32L07x_Rev1.1.1 Release 2020-06-02:
1. Added and improved initialization of unblocked IO in low-power mode;

==>>HC32L07x_Rev1.1.0 Release 2019-12-27:
1. Optimized the (LP) UART baud rate algorithm;
2. Updated USB and I2S architecture and examples;
3. Updated the FLASH timing parameter configuration API;
4. Optimized PLL clock switching configuration;
5. Optimized system initialization operations;
6. Simplified the system clock switching process and provided a "one-click switching" API;
7. Added an SPI operation API, optimized API communication examples, and simplified API operations;
8. Added default output level configuration for GPIO initialization;
9. Added register bit operation macros to ddl.h;

